板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(19年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,94.3 9.1,97.2 14.2,94.4 19.3,90.2 24.5,88.0 29.6,86.5 34.7,84.1 39.8,80.7 44.9,73.0 50.0,74.3 55.1,78.4 60.3,73.3 65.4,70.4 70.5,62.3 75.6,66.3 80.7,70.4 85.8,62.9 91.0,58.5 96.1,56.4 101.2,52.0 106.3,49.8 111.4,59.3 116.5,60.9 121.6,63.4 126.8,64.1 131.9,63.7 137.0,59.2 142.1,60.0 147.2,62.7 152.3,64.0 157.4,67.3 162.6,64.4 167.7,48.3 172.8,44.8 177.9,56.1 183.0,53.3 188.1,54.9 193.2,41.1 198.4,40.4 203.5,39.4 208.6,55.1 213.7,49.1 218.8,44.2 223.9,44.4 229.0,35.5 234.2,24.2 239.3,28.3 244.4,32.1 249.5,31.4 254.6,30.8 259.7,22.5 264.9,21.1 270.0,15.9 275.1,26.7 280.2,19.2 285.3,24.1 290.4,29.8 295.5,31.0 300.7,25.8 305.8,24.0 310.9,12.8 316.0,15.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"15.2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,96.4 6.1,94.9 8.3,95.3 10.4,95.3 12.5,96.0 14.7,95.3 16.8,95.1 19.0,96.9 21.1,97.2 23.2,95.6 25.4,93.5 27.5,93.1 29.6,91.8 31.8,91.4 33.9,91.6 36.1,80.3 38.2,82.7 40.3,79.3 42.5,77.2 44.6,78.1 46.7,76.0 48.9,75.9 51.0